He's just there to be annoying. The usual way of dealing with this is to
move to a space three squares away from the stairs, wait for him to appear
next to you, then run to the stairs and leave the level, leaving him
behind. Be sure you're not wielding Stormbringer while he's on the same
level as you are. A slip of your fingers will get him hostile, and your
character dead.

Hope this was hinty enough to not be spoily.

